79,zoom=16)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"> })</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">}</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">  </div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">ui.r------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">library(leaflet)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">library(shiny)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">fluidPage(</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"> h1(&quot;hpc map test&quot;),</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"> leafletOutput(&#39;map&#39;,width = &quot;100%&quot;,height = 400)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">[error information</span>]</b></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif\">web error</p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-family:monospace,monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.0196078);border-width:1px;borde